0..78 Comment "// Codes `Eq.generic` reads but derives no equality from yet (#2345). `List`\'s"
79..157 Comment "// code is `1` for `Nil` and `field(a) × var List` for `Cons`: the leaf reads"
158..234 Comment "// the parameter, whose equality the derivation would need supplied. A `rec`"
235..312 Comment "// block\'s pair reads as two codes of one sort each, each naming the other in"
313..381 Comment "// a leaf rather than as a `var`, so the pair is a cycle through two"
382..461 Comment "// declarations, not one recursion; it needs a code of two sorts and one mutual"
462..482 Comment "// fixpoint over it."
